WEBVTT

00:00:00.053 --> 00:00:03.105
Planning connects your work to other people’s plans Planning

00:00:03.132 --> 00:00:06.066
means deciding what result is needed and working out

00:00:06.132 --> 00:00:11.224
the actions people information resources and timing required to

00:00:11.224 --> 00:00:15.803
achieve it A useful plan also identifies how progress

00:00:15.842 --> 00:00:17.737
will be checked and what must happen when a

00:00:17.789 --> 00:00:23.474
condition changes Your plan affects other people A stakeholder

00:00:23.474 --> 00:00:26.618
is a person or function whose work decision or

00:00:26.645 --> 00:00:30.395
interests affect or are affected by the plan Before

00:00:30.461 --> 00:00:33.711
promising a time or result you check their existing

00:00:33.763 --> 00:00:37.053
commitments the inputs they must supply and whether they

00:00:37.053 --> 00:00:40.671
have accepted the work The parts must fit together

00:00:40.684 --> 00:00:43.355
like a puzzle an empty space in your diary

00:00:43.382 --> 00:00:46.855
is not evidence that everyone else is ready For

00:00:46.855 --> 00:00:50.171
example a decision meeting depends on more than an

00:00:50.211 --> 00:00:56.171
invitation The executive needs preparation time finance and operations

00:00:56.184 --> 00:00:59.474
need time to supply current papers and Daniel needs

00:00:59.474 --> 00:01:03.513
a review point to identify gaps If one input

00:01:03.526 --> 00:01:07.026
is late the people responsible must understand the effect

00:01:07.105 --> 00:01:11.539
and agree the next action Planning makes those dependencies

00:01:11.553 --> 00:01:14.789
visible rather than leaving others to discover a conflict
